language's MLS library) was read, consulted as a design reference, or
ported from for this module. Every algorithm was implemented directly
from RFC 9420's own text/pseudocode (item 1/2) and verified against the
public interop vectors (items 3/4) — the same "spec + KAT, no third-party
source" posture this repo's `hpke`/`signal` NOTICE-free modules document
in their own SPEC.md "no NOTICE entry" reasoning; this file exists only
because items 3/4's vector-fetch and item 2's direct-port relationship
warrant the same explicit-citation caution `bn254`/`bls12_381` apply to
their own KAT sources.
